I have finished talking with her. I did not need to force her. She was created to protect the God of Fire's heart and soul. But the Fire Soul split into several parts; they are the fragments we have been collecting, and also the cause of the earthquakes.
Created by the God of Fire, she does not know her creator's name.
She speaks well. She is very calm, logical and calculating. She shows no emotion and does not tell good from evil. She only wants to fulfill the mission she was given and will fulfill it whatever the cost, while she waits for her master's return.
I will try to get more information. Come back in a while.

[Challenge Objective]

Talk to Sage Celina in Pillai.
